The files in tests/fixtures/official/ and the file
examples/official-ap2-v0.2-docs.bundle.json contain sample tokens taken,
unmodified, from the AP2 documentation (google-agentic-commerce/AP2,
https://github.com/google-agentic-commerce/AP2, commit
e1ea56db72a6385bce3e5c1112b3a56ce60acb43), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Third-party test vectors in tests/fixtures/third-party/. Each directory holds
converted files only: every *.bundle.json re-wraps one vector of the source
into the ap2-evidence/1 bundle format (tokens and public keys copied unchanged,
public keys converted from PEM to JWK where the source gives PEM; expected
aud/nonce moved into the bundle); MANIFEST.json records the original file of
each vector, the author's expected outcome and our results. The source's
licence files are copied verbatim into the directory. The conversion is done by
tools/cross_check/convert.py.

